('c06a7bec-cbb3-5efa-aea9-babd5d7fa85c', 'steel-asphalt-rake-long-18-shank', 'Steel Asphalt Rake Long 18" Shank', '2dedf35c-574c-56f3-8050-1b2212ba7145', '4fabb7f5-64aa-5b5e-961d-be4e64f7e7d5', '8fbfd445-4489-58ce-a412-ae96bace03f9', 'Heavy-duty construction designed for tough use in asphalt paving. The 16" wide head features 14 teeth that extend down 3-1/4" to move through material. 18" long shank provides extra reach to burn asphalt build-up. Sturdy wood handle is 60" long. Entire length of the tool is 78".', '[]'::jsonb, '{}'::jsonb, 100, false, false, false),
